---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, ADS_ENABLED } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE.name}`}
  description="What data we collect, what we do not, and how our calculators work entirely in your browser without sending anything to us."
  crumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]}
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="tool-header">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="tool-standfirst">Last updated 7 August 2026.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tool-body">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>The short version</h2>
        <p>
          Every calculation on this site runs inside your browser. Your salary, property price,
          redundancy package and everything else you type is never sent to us, never stored, and
          never seen by any server. There is no account to create and no email address to give.
        </p>

        <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Anything you enter into a calculator.</li>
          <li>Your name, email address, or contact details, unless you email us directly.</li>
          <li>Your financial information in any form.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Calculator inputs are held only in your browser's memory and in the page URL, so you can
          bookmark or share a result. Closing the tab discards them.
        </p>

        <h2>What is collected automatically</h2>
        <p>
          Our hosting provider records standard server logs when a page is requested: IP address,
          browser type, the page requested, and the time. These are used to keep the site running and
          secure. We do not use them to identify individuals.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        {
          ADS_ENABLED ? (
            <>
              <p>
                We show advertising through Google AdSense, which uses cookies to serve and measure
                ads. You are asked for consent before any advertising cookie is set, and you can
                change or withdraw that consent at any time.
              </p>
              <p>
                Google may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other
                sites. You can opt out of personalised advertising in your{' '}
                <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">
                  Google Ad Settings
                </a>
                , or opt out of third-party vendor cookies at{' '}
                <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">
                  aboutads.info
                </a>
                .
              </p>
            </>
          ) : (
            <p>
              This site currently sets no cookies at all. We use no analytics, no tracking pixels and
              no advertising scripts. If that changes we will ask for your consent first and update
              this page.
            </p>
          )
        }

        <h2>Third parties</h2>
        <p>
          The site loads no external fonts, scripts or images. Links to gov.uk, Revenue Scotland and
          other sources are ordinary links — following one takes you to a site with its own privacy
          policy.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Under UK GDPR you have rights to access, correct and erase personal data held about you.
          Because we do not collect or store personal data through the calculators, in practice there
          is normally nothing for us to hold. If you have emailed us, you can ask us to delete that
          correspondence at any time.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at{' '}
          <a href="https://ico.org.uk/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">ico.org.uk</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
          This site is intended for adults dealing with their own tax affairs. We do not knowingly
          collect data from children.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          If this policy changes we will update the date at the top. Material changes — particularly
          anything involving cookies or advertising — will be flagged on the site.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about privacy: <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
